{"articleNo":"497216","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=497216&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2024-2학기 폐강, 합반과목 안내 및 수강정정신청 안내","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2024.08.28","hit":"10632","attachments":[{"name":"대상강좌 확정 내역_공지.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=497216&attachNo=137042"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2024-2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 폐강,합반과목을 붙임과&nbsp;같이 공고하오니 대상과목을 수강 신청한 학생은 다른 과목으로 기간 내에 변경하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1.&nbsp;</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">정정신청기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">수강신청과목 변경,정정신청기간에 수강신청</span></span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp; 폐강, 합반과목 대상자의 경우 변경, 정정신청기간에 여석없는강좌 각&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3과목씩 가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b>2. 합반강좌의 경우 수강신청처리되어 있으며, 기존강좌와 시간이 겹치는지 반드시 확인하여 겹칠 경우 수강 정정</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt;\">3. 유의사항 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">지도교수와 수강상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">추가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">가능</span></p><div><span style=\"text-indent: -22.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
